  chk(/late payment|interest|late fee/,'Late-payment interest','Nothing compensates you if the 90 days is exceeded.');
  chk(/disclos|#ad|paid partnership|asci/,'Paid partnership disclosure','No clause says how the partnership is labelled. Disclosure is still required on your posts.');
  chk(/terminat/,'Termination rights','No way to exit the agreement or end the licence.');
  chk(/governing law|jurisdiction|arbitrat/,'Governing law and jurisdiction','You cannot tell where a dispute would be heard.');
  chk(/approv/,'Brand approval deadline','No deadline for brand sign-off, so revisions can drag on.');
  chk(/extension|renewal|additional fee|separate fee/,'Fee for extra usage','No mechanism to be paid if the brand wants more usage later.');
